Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.27,TItle2,,0,0,0,,{\frz1.891\frx4\fry12\pos(401.062,316)}WIDESCREEN EDITION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:12.08,Shochiku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364.755,338)}SHOCHIKU COMPANY, LTD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:22.21,TItle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)\b0\fs99\pos(358.845,86)}TAIKO CHRONICLES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:22.21,TItle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)\pos(354.624,337)}THE SAGA OF HIDEYOSHI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:29.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.377,361)}Original story by: YOSHIKAWA Eiji \NScreenplay by: IDE Masato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:40.30,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(485.495,168)}Directed by:\NOSONE Tatsuo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Push it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,WARRING STATES ERA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,1536: YEAR OF THE MONKEY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought he'd be stillborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, you have an heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He may look wrinkled as a prune now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our rice fields may be stripped by war,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but farmer's wives are still fertile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as we're healthy,\Nwe'll raise a happy child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Onaka, and if our boy is healthy too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,my dream can come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'll raise him as a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our life may be poor but if we\Nwork together I'll be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,6 YEARS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Hiyoshi!\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Otsumi, take it from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka, leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy is too restless for his mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,he has his father's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they'll carry him off\Nto fight the wars when he grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka, I'm a man without education,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why I'm just a burden to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Does your wound trouble you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain is bad these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You should rest, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, it's the day your father died,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,chant the sutras from your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys, today I'm the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.26,0:07:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, everyone attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You decapitated Buddha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's not nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Noise and more noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, Buddha will punish you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just made of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't pray or believe in it, it's just wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't hurt me!\N- What a disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Monk, be careful with Buddha's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They say you broke the Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You shamed your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka, I was shamed in front\Nof everybody because of Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, apologize to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you call me father?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would pay attention to you, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No appreciation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All you do is take her money and drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why everybody\Nfeels sorry for mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A brat like you had better\Ngo and earn his own living!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come back you're\Nnot staying, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.29,0:10:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart-mouth brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so red!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, I'm sorry, you can't\Nstay here anymore, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to understand how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then please go and find work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll speak to the landlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it for your mother, is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With this cloth, we'll make an important flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful not to drop it.\N- What's a flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They carry it in wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it needs to be a strong color, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!\NWhy did you put it in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you watch him?\NStupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like good color for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Marching colors are all brown!\NYou can't change them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't keep you here anymore.\NGet lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir?\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Our banner, is it ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's out back.\NBut there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the judge of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies will see it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fine job!\NWho made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A small boy.\NWithout permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a smart lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him a bonus.\NWhere is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you the truth, I fired him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You fired him?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?\NYou're a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Onaka, he's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He interrupts adults, talks back too\Nmuch and takes advantage of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When we discipline him, he makes excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't vouch for him again,\Nor he'll ruin my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get fired again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is stepfather here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't come back today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is mother alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not upset with you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?\NReally, you're not mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, for the next ten\Nyears please forget I exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All | want is to be a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I know you don't\Nwant me to be a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be a samurai!\N- Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I have my father's samurai blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:17:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, in our family my father\Nand grandfather were samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My late father said I have samurai blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can be a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But he said don't follow him,\Nso I must be better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the sword he kept in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's rusted, can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say yes, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.31,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me follow the samurai path!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, may I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword, may 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carry it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not in my care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a great samurai someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back to get you and sister, wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with mother forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll count on you. sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you all you need when you marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the money father set aside for my kimono...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take it, you can't get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get married until you're a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is mother's lucky pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, mother.\NI'll be back, as a fine samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll leave behind rice for you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I am up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!\N- No! I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Brat!\N- Brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're disturbing my sleep.\NHow can I be in your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk back to me!\NYou little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lad, where's your home town?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When you ask, you\Nshould identify yourself first!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the Owari country.\NHe is Sir Hachisuka Koroku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?\N- Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Nakamura village in Owari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're from home,\NI'll let you have the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, you forgot to tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They call me "Saru” (Monkey)\Nbut my real name is Hiyoshimaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bring water!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you carry it?\N- He offered to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a horse bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we just watered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.01,0:23:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's cool, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to work for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?\N- I want a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword?\NI'll give you one from the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.24,0:23:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked them all over.\NThey're no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled them from the scabbards?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.08,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to watch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a sword like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That one?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:24:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, steal it without\Ngetting caught within 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I said 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.08,0:24:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.70,0:25:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shichiuchi, the boss says\Nyou two have to pull this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.27,0:25:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.55,0:25:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop that noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm off to find a lord to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"Please save my sword\Nuntil I'm a real samurai.”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,SURUGA
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,SAGAMI
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,KAI
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:27:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,MINO
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.98,0:27:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Goroji!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.58,0:27:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, you left home to\Nbecome a samurai then...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.96,0:27:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.23,0:27:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've searched the country to find a lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I still can't find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.83,0:27:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.\NHope you find him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.70,0:27:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.67,0:27:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone merchant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.24,0:27:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.01,0:27:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.58,0:28:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.78,0:28:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.87,0:28:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,OWARI: KIYOSU CASTLE TOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.22,0:29:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.35,0:29:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not him!\NI was mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.22,0:29:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A mistaken attack on a samurai?\NSo you're an assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.12,0:29:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No.I am...\N- Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you from Mino?\NKofu, Izu or Mikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you spy for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a festival day.\NDon't bother with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.97,0:30:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.74,0:30:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.47,0:30:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.78,0:30:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.61,0:30:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you have the wrong man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.78,0:30:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.79,0:30:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's no mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you still won't take my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.73,0:30:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a party!\NEverybody dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.13,0:31:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.16,0:31:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.53,0:31:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.56,0:32:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.07,0:32:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.61,0:32:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.08,0:32:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I'm the son of Kinoshita Yaemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.95,0:32:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,who served with your father, Lord Nobuhide.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.85,0:32:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinoshita Tokichiro is my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.52,0:32:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to serve you, Lord Nobunaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.46,0:32:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will have no choice\Nbut to stay a homeless vagabond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to serve me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd die for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.91,0:32:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of skills do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.18,0:32:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No special skills my lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.51,0:33:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will gladly die for\Nyou when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.95,0:33:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fit to die for me without serving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we come from the same town
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.19,0:33:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I searched for a lord to serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.83,0:33:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it became my dream to serve only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.54,0:33:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.61,0:33:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.53,0:33:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, "Saru!"\NYou do resemble a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.70,0:33:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!\NGo to the back and follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.03,0:34:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.93,0:35:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Onaka is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Hiyoshi\Ngave her such fine gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.71,0:35:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka must be so proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.21,0:35:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought her so many tears as a lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was a good-natured boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Chikuami was alive, he'd be so pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.79,0:35:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chikuami was strict with Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hiyoshi was a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.30,0:35:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, he was born nearly\Nhalf-dead and wrinkled like a prune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.18,0:35:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Landlord, Hiyoshi sent\Nthis letter, please read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.79,0:36:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi is now Kinoshita Tokichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.03,0:36:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.07,0:36:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"If I'm promoted and get a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"I will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.71,0:36:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't have the samurai\Nlineage or social standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.95,0:36:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"but I will always do my best."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord is leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:37:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, were you sitting on my slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.92,0:37:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.82,0:37:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.03,0:37:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, I was warming them with my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.46,0:37:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.73,0:37:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.24,0:37:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"If my job is merely to\Nprepare the lord's slippers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.91,0:37:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,“then that is just what I'll do."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.45,0:37:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,KITCHEN DEPARTMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,KITCHEN DEPARTMENT “Lord Nobunaga\Nhas promoted me to kitchen manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.46,0:37:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,“Lord Nobunaga has promoted\Nme to kitchen manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.86,0:37:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have worked very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.33,0:37:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"The result is that I have\Nbeen promoted once again."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.30,0:37:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the boss is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.90,0:37:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.44,0:37:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey face?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.98,0:38:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.81,0:38:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, call me monkey face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cringe when you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.38,0:38:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So call me monkey face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.59,0:38:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to spare charcoal, you'll\Nwarm your face and freeze your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.86,0:38:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, throw more coals in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's work, but ask\Nstorage to send more coals.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.60,0:38:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.57,0:38:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This boss shows great understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.58,0:38:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You want us to give the\Nworkers combat training?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.22,0:38:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just sitting around indoors all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.52,0:38:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so instead of worrying about\Nsaving coals we'll get them outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.49,0:38:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,practicing fighting skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This way we can keep them busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.63,0:38:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, thank you for listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.33,0:38:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, don't you ever hold your\Ntongue, even with your officers?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.57,0:39:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, lord. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.31,0:39:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.11,0:39:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know your job, conserving\Nfuel in the kitchen department?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.22,0:39:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone says it's a bad idea to\Nleave you in charge of kitchens.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maeda Inuchiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.48,0:40:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you out of the kitchens,\Nand making you head of stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.56,0:40:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 30 stables, with samurai\Nrank and a house in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.83,0:40:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.87,0:40:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.74,0:40:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, no objections!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.34,0:40:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo, now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.05,0:40:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.91,0:40:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,RICE CAKES
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.79,0:40:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.49,0:40:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Asano.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.26,0:41:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some tea, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.67,0:41:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.31,0:41:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my daughter, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.45,0:41:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.38,0:41:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kinoshita Tokichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.05,0:41:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was promoted from the kitchens,\Nnow he's the stable manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.15,0:41:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.19,0:41:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene, you know Kinoshita already?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.79,0:41:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.86,0:41:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.20,0:41:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's written letters to me, and he sent me gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.24,0:41:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.57,0:41:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.31,0:41:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you take gifts without telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.48,0:41:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.85,0:41:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When he sends a gift we send it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.15,0:42:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.45,0:42:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.96,0:42:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard you were a man to watch,\Nbut not that you had eyes for my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.43,0:42:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.50,0:42:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene, forget this wild man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.27,0:42:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Matazo, take Nene back to the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.14,0:42:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.64,0:42:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.04,0:42:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She is dried fish in front of a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.18,0:42:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.18,0:42:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.99,0:42:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.99,0:42:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita, I need to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.37,0:42:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This Maeda Inuchiyo, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.47,0:42:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.20,0:42:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth, Sir Maeda\Nasked for Nene in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.01,0:43:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I agreed without asking Nene first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.75,0:43:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When I spoke to Nene about it,\Nshe wouldn't even answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.35,0:43:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's because Miss Nene\Ndoesn't like Sir Maeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.66,0:43:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So I might have chosen the wrong man?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.23,0:43:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall I do about it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.97,0:43:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maeda is a very influential man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.14,0:43:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a very high-ranking samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.84,0:43:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I could be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.21,0:43:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I force Nene to marry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.65,0:43:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Miss Nene will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.05,0:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Die?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.35,0:43:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.52,0:43:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Asano...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.66,0:43:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is try.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.64,0:43:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can straighten it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.61,0:44:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.61,0:44:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.51,0:44:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll speak to Sir Maeda?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.86,0:44:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.13,0:44:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.97,0:44:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.87,0:44:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fond of Asano Mataemon's\Ndaughter, Miss Nene, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.61,0:44:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I asked for her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.85,0:44:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem.\N- A problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.62,0:44:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.82,0:44:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene and I have loved\Neach other for along time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.19,0:44:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, we're also engaged to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.86,0:44:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, don't joke around with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.43,0:45:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm telling the truth, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.67,0:45:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.24,0:45:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you don't have any\Nobjection to our marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.81,0:45:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?\N- Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks are going to laugh at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.98,0:45:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.42,0:45:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Maeda, you're sure you don't object?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.82,0:45:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Nene will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.36,0:45:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, are you really serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.80,0:45:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm bothering you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.44,0:45:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were an understanding man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.97,0:45:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.28,0:45:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene will be happy when I tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.15,0:45:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.61,0:46:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yamabuse Chohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.49,0:46:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.86,0:46:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.96,0:46:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinano, Sunpu, or Imagawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.63,0:46:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.53,0:46:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no Oda clansman, you're from Narumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.24,0:46:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Narumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.61,0:47:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabuse, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.09,0:47:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.63,0:47:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Maeda killed Yamabuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.80,0:47:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to Maeda?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.80,0:47:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle rules say the\Nlord must send him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.40,0:47:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.87,0:48:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Maeda, is that you?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.35,0:48:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.85,0:48:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting ready to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.56,0:48:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord was not pleased with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.23,0:48:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving up Miss Nene and leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Inuchiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.04,0:49:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was engaged to Miss Nene...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.71,0:49:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.58,0:49:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied because Miss Nene\Nwasn't ready to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.92,0:49:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.73,0:49:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been afraid I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.67,0:49:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.40,0:49:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.87,0:49:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is I was fond of Miss Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.58,0:49:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I know who Nene really wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.72,0:49:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, it is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.95,0:49:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't joke with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.75,0:49:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, go ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.59,0:49:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell Sir Mataemon that if he lets\NMiss Nene marry anyone but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.23,0:50:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo will kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.37,0:50:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the man for Miss Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.29,0:50:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, let me see you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.49,0:50:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to see a monkey with a sad face.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, take care of Miss Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.95,0:50:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.39,0:50:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Inuchiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.89,0:51:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.96,0:51:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will come back to Kiyosu again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.63,0:51:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.18,0:51:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita, we heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.02,0:51:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.36,0:51:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for Sir Maeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.09,0:51:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess he had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.83,0:51:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, please let me marry Sir Kinoshita.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.10,0:51:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fond wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.84,0:51:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Nene, you wouldn't mind\Nhaving me for a husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.81,0:51:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.08,0:51:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita, please marry my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.02,0:52:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.76,0:52:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,IN MAY OF 1560, IMAGAWA YOSHIMOTO\NLEFT SUNPU TO CONQUER THE ODA.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,HE LED AN ARMY OF 30,000 MEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,AFTER 13 DAYS, THEY\NARRIVED IN ODA TERRITORY.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.70,0:53:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At 4 o'clock this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.97,0:53:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the Imagawa stormed into our castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.84,0:53:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough men!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.31,0:53:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't hold out much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.41,0:53:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lose every man if nobody helps!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.35,0:53:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell the lord!\NI beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.49,0:53:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord is asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.66,0:54:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, your horse is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.70,0:55:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, I will perform a Noh dance,\Nbefore you ride to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.51,0:55:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon my lord, then I will sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.65,0:55:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to sing?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.68,0:55:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,From my heart, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.75,0:55:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, then sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.07,0:56:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.30,0:56:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.78,0:58:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.12,0:58:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy, he's taken the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.42,0:58:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.16,0:58:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imagawa have wheeled\Naround to the opposite direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Yoshimoto, he'll try to attack Kiyosu next!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.46,0:58:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.43,0:58:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.13,0:58:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.27,0:58:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Inuchiya...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord waited for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.21,0:59:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, let's die for our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.94,0:59:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.05,0:59:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.15,0:59:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Inuchiya, you're back?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.85,0:59:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.36,0:59:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.17,1:01:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,1560, MAY 19TH. ODA NOBUNAGA\NDEFEATS IMAGAWA YOSHIMOTO.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.23,1:02:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.36,1:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sir Maeda.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.89,1:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back to celebrate your wedding!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.49,1:02:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.83,1:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please join us!\NI'm son-in-law to this house now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.60,1:02:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come this way.\NEverybody, come close.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.00,1:02:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.18,1:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now join us for some saké!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.16,1:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, he is a fine son-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.13,1:03:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.50,1:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.00,1:03:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.04,1:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! The groom, please drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.84,1:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine day!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.18,1:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the bride!\NAren't you lovely!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.55,1:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, don't we need more women?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.72,1:03:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sir Groom, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.39,1:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But...\N- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.64,1:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.71,1:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go home tonight!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.31,1:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care where you go, I'm with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.19,1:04:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.14,1:05:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.37,1:05:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.28,1:05:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to leave you alone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.55,1:05:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to part with friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.32,1:05:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.59,1:05:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Being here makes me happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.76,1:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget this night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.86,1:05:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly feel that way?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.54,1:05:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we had better talk about something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.65,1:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.16,1:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a gift that my mother\Nmade with her own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.73,1:06:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She never thought of herself...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.74,1:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But did everything she\Ncould to help her children.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.68,1:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't understand society or\Nmanners and can't speak properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.52,1:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene, can you obey as daughter-in-law,\Neven though she is a poor villager?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.12,1:06:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.26,1:06:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Her happiness will be my happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.40,1:06:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will respect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.70,1:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.80,1:06:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, about me, my job, my duty...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.61,1:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you enjoy sharing this life with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.35,1:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.72,1:07:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must hear your wishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.36,1:07:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want in life, I'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.13,1:07:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the love of a good husband?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.31,1:07:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me fine children, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.19,1:07:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations my son,\Non your wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.56,1:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you'd like me to\Ncome to Kiyosu and live with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.27,1:07:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't wish to burden you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.24,1:08:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially now that you\Nhave realized your dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.48,1:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are the right hand\Nman to a great lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.32,1:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy to stay here in\Nyour home village in Nakamura
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.43,1:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and pray every day for\Nyour happiness to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.63,1:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister Otsumi is still unmarried...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.90,1:08:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me she prays each day...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.81,1:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For your success and like me she\Nlongs to see you again one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.19,1:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,THE YEAR 1566
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.56,1:08:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,OWARI
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.40,1:08:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,SUNOMATA
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.27,1:09:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To provide a foothold for the invasion of Mino\Nprovince, a castle in Sunomata had to be built.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.74,1:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuma Nobumori led the first group of builders,\Nbut they were utterly defeated by the Mino clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.09,1:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The second attempt by Shibata Katsuie. The\Nthird by Oda Kageyu. Both were unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.78,1:09:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Oda Kageyu and 90 more\Nwere killed or injured.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.45,1:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Workers were drowned\Nor shot where they stood.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.58,1:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even lay a foundation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.82,1:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The land sits on a flood plain,\Nsurrounded by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.19,1:10:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could possibly build a castle there!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.77,1:10:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Will no one offer me a solution?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.90,1:10:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.94,1:10:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear we'll have to forget the\Nidea of building a castle in Sunomata.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.48,1:10:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.88,1:10:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.58,1:10:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it impossible?!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.60,1:10:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokichiro!\N- My lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.37,1:10:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you think!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.30,1:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.28,1:10:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.38,1:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear what the retainers are saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.98,1:10:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're afraid of water,\Nyou can't build anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.42,1:10:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fear your enemies,\Nyou'll never face them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.09,1:11:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We know it's impossible,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.99,1:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but with brains and determination,\Nvictory can be ours for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The central problem is how we build on water,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.50,1:11:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and the strength of the soil.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.80,1:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't make nature our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.31,1:11:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.94,1:11:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't yet have a plan,\Nbut the key is in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.71,1:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers?\NAre you asking for 5,000 men?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.58,1:11:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need so many.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.29,1:11:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How many men do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.46,1:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it with 300 men.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.58,1:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How many men, he says?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.72,1:12:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do it with 300!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.06,1:12:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene, good news!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.19,1:12:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Sunomata.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.93,1:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunomata?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.06,1:12:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sunomata.\NI leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.40,1:12:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have my own castle soon.\NI'll be master of a castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.67,1:12:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it hasn't been built yet\Nbut my lord asks me to go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.41,1:12:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If 1 build it we'll bring mother to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.18,1:12:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.83,1:12:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why cry, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.13,1:12:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's dangerous in Sunomata.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.27,1:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Many have died there, but I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.07,1:12:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.41,1:12:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Maeda is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.21,1:13:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.08,1:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.82,1:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This Sunomata task has frightened her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.62,1:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.05,1:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, I don't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.56,1:13:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tough job you've taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.46,1:13:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you but I'm still afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.00,1:13:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.20,1:13:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You always take my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.07,1:13:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The task has beaten\Nhigher ranking men than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.21,1:13:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll risk my life and do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.54,1:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But if anything happens, please\Ntake care of Nene and my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.39,1:13:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.\NLeave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will you bring to Sunomata?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.83,1:13:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.70,1:13:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.80,1:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Ronin.\N- Ronin?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.73,1:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Hachisuka Koroku and his men.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.14,1:14:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachisuka? Bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.27,1:14:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He belongs to the Saito clan from Mino.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.57,1:14:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.31,1:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent a letter last night.\NHere's his reply.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.66,1:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But, he's refused you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.12,1:14:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he refused.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.67,1:14:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon, Nobunaga's messenger is at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.77,1:14:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I see the man?\NGet rid of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.11,1:14:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But sir, it's Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.71,1:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Monkey face" Hiyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.01,1:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You recall the kid we picked\Nup at the river years back?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.58,1:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That monkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.62,1:14:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.66,1:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.23,1:15:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long, more than 10 years already.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.50,1:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This brings back memories, such fond memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.84,1:15:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone for your slippers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.45,1:15:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.28,1:15:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a samurai?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.95,1:15:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. As you see, with the Oda clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.85,1:15:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a world this is!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.69,1:15:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kinoshita Tokichiro, on an\Nerrand for my lord, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.60,1:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.03,1:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.93,1:15:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.20,1:15:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm claiming the sword you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.94,1:15:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.01,1:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give a thing to Nobunaga's errand boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.98,1:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.38,1:15:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never provided me\Nwith a single grain of rice!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.15,1:16:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nerve playing good samaritan!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.62,1:16:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Nobunaga to come if he wants to talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.59,1:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead wrong.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.83,1:16:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to give up your old Maniji flags,\Nand join a new alliance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.67,1:16:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I can kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.11,1:16:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I speak not for myself but for Lord Oda...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.34,1:16:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I speak for the warriors who have fought\Nnearly 100 years since the war of Onin,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.22,1:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,praying for days of peace to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.55,1:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Words!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.52,1:16:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down and listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.72,1:16:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a man who leads\N2,000 vassals, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.93,1:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.41,1:16:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This man has a fine aura.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.38,1:16:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What aura?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.85,1:17:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It foretells happiness for the people.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.22,1:17:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good, like the Buddhist teaching.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.22,1:17:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you relax?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.26,1:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't scare him with that spear.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.37,1:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear him out, then decide what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.77,1:17:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.28,1:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Now if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.06,1:17:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.80,1:17:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.20,1:17:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, let me ask you.\NWhat is loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.31,1:17:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.14,1:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.88,1:18:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are these Saito\Nthat Hachisuka is loyal to?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.05,1:18:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.68,1:18:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They fight among themselves, brother\Nkilling brother, killing neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.02,1:18:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows what to think\Nof them and everyone is afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.26,1:18:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, I'm sure you know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.26,1:18:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But you try to serve\Nthem and still you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.60,1:18:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think people find that admirable?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.84,1:18:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You remain loyal to these petty\Nsouls and fail to reach for greatness.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.81,1:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not open your eyes and\Nsee this chance to achieve it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.65,1:18:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, Oda Nobunaga\Nstands before your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.79,1:18:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to\Nbuild a castle in Sunomata,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.86,1:18:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and clear the way for the conquest of Mino.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.97,1:19:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If we miss this chance at greatness,\Nhow can we build a better future?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.67,1:19:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here now, asking you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.98,1:19:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, this is my chance\Nto repay you for your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.18,1:19:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have tea and think it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.99,1:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That samurai, did he once work for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.03,1:19:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the brat in a field.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.63,1:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Brat?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.66,1:20:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.93,1:20:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You see a boy who worked for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.14,1:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't see his virtues\Nand you shut your ears to his advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.54,1:20:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But one look shows me his success, and more...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.12,1:20:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that he shall rule the nation one day!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.36,1:20:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.66,1:20:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look with your guts, not your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.57,1:20:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you reject this messenger\Ntoday you'll regret it for 100 years!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.92,1:20:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, it doesn't matter what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.69,1:21:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What he is telling you is certainly the\Ntruth and it's a mirror of God's teaching.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.33,1:21:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And more, his honesty and his passion...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.14,1:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It will make him a great\Nleader in years to come!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.51,1:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku, can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.88,1:21:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Monk...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.55,1:21:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will heed your words.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.42,1:21:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know now...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.96,1:21:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking inside that he is the\Nbetter man and I will follow him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.47,1:21:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.98,1:22:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.55,1:22:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobunaga orders us to build this\Ncastle in Sunomata, any way we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.09,1:22:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle belongs to none, it is\Nour castle and we will build it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.50,1:22:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll live in this castle\Nfor generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.90,1:22:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come through war after war\Nand hard days without hope or fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.74,1:22:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But now is the time to make\Na life for ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.54,1:22:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no one's castle but\Nours, and we'll build it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.75,1:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll build it with our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.34,1:23:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.95,1:23:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you lift it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.95,1:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.39,1:23:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.29,1:23:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.87,1:24:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gorohachi!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.41,1:24:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.18,1:24:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't cry.\NIf you were alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.85,1:24:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you come see me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.49,1:24:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to see you until\Nwe finished building the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.93,1:24:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.\NWe're pals from the old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.00,1:24:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi, I was so happy you made general.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.87,1:24:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I not only brought my wife,\NI brought 50 of my friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.98,1:24:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.91,1:24:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep watching us work.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.68,1:24:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll work hard, and we'll build this castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.19,1:24:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't pitch in when the work is hard,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.29,1:24:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,how can we hold our heads up at temple?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.66,1:24:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.76,1:25:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't work too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.87,1:25:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my wife.\NDue any day.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.45,1:25:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorohachi, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.12,1:25:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.34,1:27:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the enemy is holding back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.75,1:27:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They think Tokichiro the farmer\Ngeneral is bound to be weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.82,1:27:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So they'll just wait until\Nwe're nearly finished building,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.86,1:27:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,then they'll mount a massive attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.80,1:27:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So they underestimate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.57,1:27:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My point exactly!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.61,1:28:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend Gorohachi's baby is born!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.45,1:28:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice healthy cries!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.45,1:28:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! A baby is born!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.75,1:28:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our baby is healthy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up and build the castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.22,1:28:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let baby go hungry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.86,1:28:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.03,1:28:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's feed the baby and build our castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.23,1:28:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.00,1:28:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Koroku!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.51,1:28:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our victory is at hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.22,1:28:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here because you're nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.49,1:28:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon be too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.66,1:28:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.43,1:29:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We let them work until they're\Nalmost finished, then strike hard?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.74,1:29:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.17,1:29:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't bear to lose so many of our men.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.88,1:29:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Lose our men?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.45,1:29:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see something strange about the\Nway they built that wall toward the water?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.13,1:29:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Their tower, the movements of the work\Nand the sound of their builders, so loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.63,1:29:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oda must have hired\Nexperts to make this incursion.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.84,1:29:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.31,1:29:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Heishiro, to handle these men.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.66,1:31:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.05,1:31:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.32,1:31:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.61,1:33:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Send in Monkey's messenger!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.94,1:33:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.75,1:33:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That damned Monkey is\Nprobably begging for more men.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.60,1:33:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.57,1:33:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Sir Kinoshita's work is done,\Nthe castle has been raised.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.07,1:33:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He begs the lord come and inspect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.67,1:33:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants me to visit?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.14,1:33:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mino's troops?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.38,1:33:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kinoshita fought hard\Nand routed all of Mino's men.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.12,1:33:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our casualties are few and\Ntheir army was annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.59,1:33:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.66,1:33:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey has done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.69,1:33:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare my horse!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.53,1:33:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At once!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.79,1:34:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokichiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.49,1:34:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.86,1:35:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work building this castle,\Nbetter work defending it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.26,1:35:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As promised, you shall live here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.90,1:35:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.87,1:35:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be rewarded soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.57,1:35:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't built this\Ncastle or defended it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.08,1:35:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These many hands and\Nmany hearts worked as one.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.02,1:35:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! I, Nobunaga thank you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.93,1:35:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Leader...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.46,1:35:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.50,1:35:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Koroku.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.94,1:35:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll serve under Sir Tokichiro\Nin this castle from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.01,1:35:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, you're the most\Nsuccessful man in Kiyosu.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:35:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on you'll raise a flag\Nand be called Hashiba Hideyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.46,1:36:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.72,1:36:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What a grand procession!\NWho could that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.85,1:36:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.26,1:36:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.89,1:36:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunamata sent a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.63,1:36:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.33,1:36:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.00,1:36:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Onaka!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.01,1:36:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My master Kinoshita Tokichiro\Nbids me to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.61,1:36:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hachisuka Koroku Masakatsu.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.18,1:37:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.66,1:37:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.86,1:37:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.25,1:38:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, it's Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.39,1:38:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.63,1:38:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.30,1:38:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so grand!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.83,1:38:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.91,1:38:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.95,1:38:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.07,1:39:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.31,1:39:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.82,1:39:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nene, you must be so tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.59,1:39:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Miss Otsumi entertained me\Nwith stories about your childhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.40,1:39:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.07,1:39:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was such a brat.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.27,1:39:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.64,1:39:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I made your life so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.14,1:39:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.18,1:39:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me a kimono\Nand sash, as you promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.19,1:39:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, come and take some rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.36,1:40:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the master of a castle shouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.87,1:40:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lords have mothers, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.54,1:40:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with a\Nboy helping his mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.47,1:40:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come. Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.78,1:40:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.02,1:40:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother brought these.\NHave a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.92,1:40:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely eggplants!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.39,1:40:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't show them to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.76,1:40:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.76,1:40:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A gift from your hard work?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.20,1:40:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best gift I've ever received.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.17,1:40:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.01,1:40:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your new castle?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.18,1:40:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and your home from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.06,1:41:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.76,1:41:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm dreaming.
